               </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Container -->\n    <main class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-12\">\n\n        <!-- Introduction Section with SEO Focus -->\n        <section class=\"mb-16\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-brand-blue mb-6 border-b-4 border-brand-orange inline-block pb-2\">Top-Tier Cassette AC Service Center Ahmedabad</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"prose lg:prose-lg text-gray-700\">\n                    <p class=\"mb-4\">\n                        <strong>Cassette AC Service Center Ahmedabad</strong> is your trusted partner for premium cooling solutions. When your office air conditioning falters, productivity drops. We understand the urgency of maintaining a comfortable environment in commercial spaces, showrooms, and large residential halls. Atlas Aircon brings you over a decade of experience in handling complex HVAC systems with precision and care.\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mb-4\">\n                        Our certified technicians are experts in diagnosing issues with ceiling-mounted units. Whether you are searching for <a href=\"/ac-repair-ahmedabad\" class=\"text-brand-blue underline\">AC repair in Ahmedabad</a> or comprehensive annual maintenance, we deliver results that last. We don&#8217;t just fix the problem; we optimize your system for energy efficiency and longevity.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        From the bustling streets of <strong>CG Road</strong> and <strong>Satellite</strong> to the industrial hubs of <strong>Vatva GIDC</strong> and <strong>Naroda</strong>, our mobile service units are equipped to reach you promptly. We pride ourselves on transparent pricing, genuine spare parts, and a customer-first approach that has made us a leading name in Gujarat&#8217;s HVAC industry.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/cassette-ac-repair-service-vadodara.png\" alt=\"Cassette AC Service Center Ahmedabad Team Working\" class=\"rounded-lg shadow-xl w-full h-auto object-cover transform hover:scale-105 transition duration-500\" title=\"\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Pros and Cons Section -->\n        <section class=\"mb-16 bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-md border border-gray-200\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-8\">Pros and Cons of Cassette Air Conditioners</h3>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n                <!-- Pros -->\n                <div>\n                    <h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-green-600 mb-4 flex items-center\"><svg class=\"w-6 h-6 mr-2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg> Advantages (Pros)</h4>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-3\">\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"checkmark mr-2\">✓</span> Space-saving ceiling-mounted design.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"checkmark mr-2\">✓</span> Uniform 4-way airflow distribution.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"checkmark mr-2\">✓</span> Aesthetics that blend with modern interiors.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"checkmark mr-2\">✓</span> High cooling capacity for large halls.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"checkmark mr-2\">✓</span> Quiet operation suitable for offices.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"checkmark mr-2\">✓</span> Energy-efficient inverter technology options.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"checkmark mr-2\">✓</span> Thermostat control for precise temperature.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <!-- Cons -->\n                <div>\n                    <h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-4 flex items-center\"><svg class=\"w-6 h-6 mr-2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M10 14l2-2m0 0l2-2m-2 2l-2-2m2 2l2 2m7-2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg> Disadvantages (Cons)</h4>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-3\">\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"xmark mr-2\">✗</span> Requires false ceiling for installation.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"xmark mr-2\">✗</span> Higher initial installation cost.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"xmark mr-2\">✗</span> Complex servicing compared to split ACs.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"xmark mr-2\">✗</span> Potential water leakage if not leveled.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"xmark mr-2\">✗</span> Requires professional maintenance strictly.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"xmark mr-2\">✗</span> Outdoor units can be bulky.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"xmark mr-2\">✗</span> Harder to retrofit in old buildings.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Brands We Service -->\n        <section class=\"mb-16\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-brand-dark mb-6 text-center\">Brands We Expertly Service in Gujarat</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-center mb-8 text-gray-600\">We provide independent, high-quality repair services for all major air conditioning brands found in local and online markets.</p>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4\">\n                <a href=\"/blue-star-ac-service-center-ahmedabad\" class=\"block p-4 bg-white border hover:shadow-lg text-center transition\">Blue Star</a>\n                <a href=\"/carrier-ac-service-center-ahmedabad\" class=\"block p-4 bg-white border hover:shadow-lg text-center transition\">Carrier</a>\n                <a href=\"/daikin-ac-service-center-ahmedabad\" class=\"block p-4 bg-white border hover:shadow-lg text-center transition\">Daikin</a>\n                <a href=\"/electrolux-ac-service-center-ahmedabad\" class=\"block p-4 bg-white border hover:shadow-lg text-center transition\">Electrolux</a>\n                <a href=\"/haier-ac-service-center-ahmedabad\" class=\"block p-4 bg-white border hover:shadow-lg text-center transition\">Haier</a>\n                <a href=\"/hitachi-ac-service-center-ahmedabad\" class=\"block p-4 bg-white border hover:shadow-lg text-center transition\">Hitachi</a>\n                <a href=\"/kelvinator-ac-service-center-ahmedabad\" class=\"block p-4 bg-white border hover:shadow-lg text-center transition\">Kelvinator</a>\n                <a href=\"/lg-ac-service-center-ahmedabad\" class=\"block p-4 bg-white border hover:shadow-lg text-center transition\">LG</a>\n                <a href=\"/mitsubishi-ac-service-center-ahmedabad\" class=\"block p-4 bg-white border hover:shadow-lg text-center transition\">Mitsubishi</a>\n                <a href=\"/o-general-ac-service-center-ahmedabad\" class=\"block p-4 bg-white border hover:shadow-lg text-center transition\">O General</a>\n                <a href=\"/onida-ac-service-center-ahmedabad\" class=\"block p-4 bg-white border hover:shadow-lg text-center transition\">Onida</a>\n                <a href=\"/panasonic-ac-service-center-ahmedabad\" class=\"block p-4 bg-white border hover:shadow-lg text-center transition\">Panasonic</a>\n                <a href=\"/samsung-ac-service-center-ahmedabad\" class=\"block p-4 bg-white border hover:shadow-lg text-center transition\">Samsung</a>\n                <a href=\"/voltas-ac-service-center-ahmedabad\" class=\"block p-4 bg-white border hover:shadow-lg text-center transition\">Voltas</a>\n                <a href=\"/york-ac-service-center-ahmedabad\" class=\"block p-4 bg-white border hover:shadow-lg text-center transition\">York</a>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Services We Offer (Types) -->\n        <section class=\"mb-16\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-brand-blue mb-8\">Which Types of Repair Service We Provide</h3>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n                <!-- Card 1 -->\n                <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md overflow-hidden\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/chiller.avif\" alt=\"Chiller Repair Services Ahmedabad\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\" title=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"p-6\">\n                        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Chiller Repair Services</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4\">Industrial cooling solutions for large scale plants.</p>\n                        <a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-ahmedabad\" class=\"text-brand-orange font-semibold hover:underline\">Learn More &rarr;</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                 <!-- Card 2 -->\n                 <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md overflow-hidden\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/cold-room-repair-service.webp\" alt=\"Cold Room Repair Services Ahmedabad\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\" title=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"p-6\">\n                        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Cold Room Repair</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4\">Preserving perishables with precision temperature control.</p>\n                        <a href=\"/cold-room-repair-services-ahmedabad\" class=\"text-brand-orange font-semibold hover:underline\">Learn More &rarr;</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                 <!-- Card 3 -->\n                 <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md overflow-hidden\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rittal-panel-ac-service.webp\" alt=\"Panel AC Service Ahmedabad\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\" title=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"p-6\">\n                        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Panel AC Service</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4\">Specialized cooling for electrical panels and CNC machines.</p>\n                        <a href=\"/panel-ac-service-ahmedabad\" class=\"text-brand-orange font-semibold hover:underline\">Learn More &rarr;</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                 <!-- Card 4 -->\n                 <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md overflow-hidden\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/deep-freezer-repair-service-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"Deep Freezer Repair Services Ahmedabad\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\" title=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"p-6\">\n                        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Deep Freezer Repair</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4\">Urgent repair services for deep freezers to prevent spoilage.</p>\n                        <a href=\"/deep-freezer-repair-services-ahmedabad\" class=\"text-brand-orange font-semibold hover:underline\">Learn More &rarr;</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                 <!-- Card 5 -->\n                 <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md overflow-hidden\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Water-Cooler-Repair-Service-near-me-in-vadodara-scaled.webp\" alt=\"Water Cooler Repair Services Ahmedabad\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\" title=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"p-6\">\n                        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Water Cooler Repair</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4\">Hygienic and cold water solutions for schools and offices.</p>\n                        <a href=\"/water-cooler-repair-services-ahmedabad\" class=\"text-brand-orange font-semibold hover:underline\">Learn More &rarr;</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                 <!-- Card 6 -->\n                 <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md overflow-hidden\">\n                    <div class=\"w-full h-48 bg-gray-200 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                         <svg class=\"w-16 h-16 text-gray-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10\"></path></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"p-6\">\n                        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Ducting Repair Services</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4\">Airflow optimization and duct cleaning services.</p>\n                        <a href=\"/ducting-repair-services-ahmedabad\" class=\"text-brand-orange font-semibold hover:underline\">Learn More &rarr;</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- More Links Text -->\n            <div class=\"mt-8 text-center\">\n                <p>We also offer <a href=\"/air-cooler-repair-services-ahmedabad\" class=\"text-brand-blue font-bold\">Air Cooler Repair</a>, <a href=\"/central-ac-repair-services-ahmedabad\" class=\"text-brand-blue font-bold\">Central AC Repair</a>, and <a href=\"/hvac-repair-services-ahmedabad\" class=\"text-brand-blue font-bold\">complete HVAC solutions</a> across the city.</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Pricing Table -->\n        <section class=\"mb-16\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-brand-dark mb-6\">Service Price List &#038; Spares</h3>\n            <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                <table class=\"min-w-full bg-white border border-gray-300 table-custom\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr class=\"bg-brand-blue text-white\">\n                            <th class=\"py-3 px-4 text-left\">Service / Product Name</th>\n                            <th class=\"py-3 px-4 text-left\">Description</th>\n                            <th class=\"py-3 px-4 text-left\">Estimated Cost (INR)</th>\n                            <th class=\"py-3 px-4 text-left\">Action</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold\">Cassette AC General Service</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4\">Filter cleaning, pressure wash, gas check</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4\">₹599 &#8211; ₹899</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4\"><a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"text-brand-orange font-bold\">Book Now</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold\">Cassette AC Chemical Wash</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4\">Deep cleaning of coils with foam chemical</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4\">₹1200 &#8211; ₹1500</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4\"><a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"text-brand-orange font-bold\">Book Now</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold\">Gas Refilling (R32/R410A)</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4\">Top-up or full gas charging per PSI</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4\">₹2500 &#8211; ₹4500</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4\"><a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"text-brand-orange font-bold\">Book Now</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold\">PCB Repair / Replacement</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4\">Circuit board diagnostics and repair</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4\">₹1500 &#8211; ₹6000</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4\"><a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"text-brand-orange font-bold\">Book Now</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold\">Cassette AC Installation</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4\">Standard installation with pipe layout</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4\">₹2500 &#8211; ₹3500</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4\"><a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"text-brand-orange font-bold\">Book Now</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-semibold\">Compressor Replacement</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4\">Rotary or Scroll Compressor (Excl. Gas)</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4\">On Request</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-3 px-4\"><a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"text-brand-orange font-bold\">Enquire</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2\">* Prices are subject to change based on brand, spare part availability, and site conditions. See our <a href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-air-conditioner-repair-service-cost-in-ahmedabad-gujarat\" class=\"underline text-brand-blue\">full price list here</a>.</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Industrial & GIDC Focus -->\n        <section class=\"mb-16 bg-brand-light p-8 rounded-xl\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-brand-blue mb-4\">Specialized Industrial AC Service in GIDC Ahmedabad</h3>\n            <p class=\"mb-4\">\n                Ahmedabad is a major industrial hub, and Atlas Aircon is dedicated to keeping your operations cool. We have specialized teams for <strong>Vatva GIDC, Naroda GIDC, Odhav GIDC, Changodar, and Sanand GIDC</strong>. \n            </p>\n            <p class=\"mb-4\">\n                Industrial cooling requires a different approach than residential ACs. Our technicians are trained to handle heavy-duty cassette units, ductable systems, and industrial chillers found in:\n            </p>\n            <ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">\n                <li>Kathwada GIDC</li>\n                <li>Aslali Industrial Area</li>\n                <li>Sarkhej-Sanand Crossroads</li>\n                <li>Narol Industrial Area</li>\n                <li>Bavla Industrial Zone</li>\n                <li>Kubadthal Industrial Estate</li>\n                <li>Kerala GIDC</li>\n                <li>Chhatral GIDC (Nearby Hub)</li>\n            </ul>\n            <div class=\"mt-6\">\n                <a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"bg-brand-dark text-white px-6 py-3 rounded hover:bg-black transition\">Request Industrial AMC Quote</a>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Common Error Codes -->\n        <section class=\"mb-16\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">Common AC Error Codes &#038; Solutions</h3>\n            <div class=\"bg-white border rounded shadow p-4\">\n                <p class=\"mb-4\">Before calling a technician, check these common error codes displayed on your Cassette AC panel:</p>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-4\">\n                    <li class=\"border-b pb-2\">\n                        <strong class=\"text-red-600\">E1 / E2:</strong> Usually indicates a room temperature sensor fault. <em>Solution: Sensor needs replacement.</em>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"border-b pb-2\">\n                        <strong class=\"text-red-600\">E3:</strong> Coil temperature sensor issue. <em>Solution: Check coil sensor resistance.</em>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"border-b pb-2\">\n                        <strong class=\"text-red-600\">E6:</strong> Communication error between indoor and outdoor units. <em>Solution: Check wiring connections.</em>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"border-b pb-2\">\n                        <strong class=\"text-red-600\">P4:</strong> Inverter compressor drive error. <em>Solution: Requires PCB or compressor diagnosis.</em>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                        <strong class=\"text-red-600\">F3:</strong> Outdoor condensation sensor error. <em>Solution: Clean outdoor unit or replace sensor.</em>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Locations Served (Residential) -->\n        <section class=\"mb-16\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-brand-blue mb-4\">Residential Areas We Serve in Ahmedabad</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">\n                Satellite | Bodakdev | Prahlad Nagar | SG Highway | Thaltej | Gota | Vastrapur | Ambawadi | Navrangpura | Naranpura | Paldi | Maninagar | Chandkheda | Motera | Sabarmati | Ranip | Bopal | South Bopal | Shela | Science City | Sola | Ghatlodia | Memnagar | Gurukul | Drive-in Road | Judges Bungalow | IIM Road | Vejalpur | Jivraj Park | Vasna | Ellisbridge | Ashram Road | Usmanpura | Shahibaug | Khanpur | Lal Darwaza | Kalupur | Dariapur | Jamalpur | Kankaria | Isanpur | Ghodasar | Narol | Vatva | Hathijan | Nikol | Odhav | Viratnagar | Bapunagar | Rakhial | Saraspur | Gomtipur | Amraiwadi | CTM | Ramol | Vastral.\n            </p>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- FAQs Section -->\n        <section class=\"mb-16\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-brand-dark mb-6\">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h3>\n            <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded shadow cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-semibold text-lg text-brand-blue group-hover:text-brand-orange flex justify-between items-center\">\n                        1. Why is my Cassette AC leaking water?\n                        <span class=\"text-2xl transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-600\">Water leakage in cassette ACs is often caused by a clogged drain pipe or a malfunctioning drain pump. Since cassette units are ceiling-mounted, the pump is crucial for pushing water out. We can service or replace this pump.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded shadow cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-semibold text-lg text-brand-blue group-hover:text-brand-orange flex justify-between items-center\">\n                        2. How much does Cassette AC service cost in Ahmedabad?\n                        <span class=\"text-2xl transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-600\">General servicing starts from ₹599. However, deep chemical cleaning (jet pump service) typically costs between ₹1200 and ₹1500 depending on the tonnage and condition of the unit.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded shadow cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-semibold text-lg text-brand-blue group-hover:text-brand-orange flex justify-between items-center\">\n                        3. Do you repair inverter Cassette ACs?\n                        <span class=\"text-2xl transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-600\">Yes, our technicians are trained to handle PCB and compressor issues for all inverter models from brands like Daikin, Mitsubishi, and LG.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded shadow cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-semibold text-lg text-brand-blue group-hover:text-brand-orange flex justify-between items-center\">\n                        4. Can you install a Cassette AC in an existing building?\n                        <span class=\"text-2xl transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-600\">Yes, but it requires a false ceiling (POP/Gypsum) with at least 1 foot of clearance space above it. We provide pre-installation site visits to assess feasibility.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded shadow cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-semibold text-lg text-brand-blue group-hover:text-brand-orange flex justify-between items-center\">\n                        5. Do you serve areas outside Ahmedabad?\n                        <span class=\"text-2xl transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-600\">Yes, we cover nearby industrial zones like Sanand, Kalol, Gandhinagar, and Changodar. Transportation charges may apply for remote locations.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded shadow cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-semibold text-lg text-brand-blue group-hover:text-brand-orange flex justify-between items-center\">\n                        6. What is included in an AMC for Cassette ACs?\n                        <span class=\"text-2xl transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-600\">Our AMC (Annual Maintenance Contract) includes 3 to 4 scheduled wet services per year and unlimited breakdown calls. It ensures your office cooling remains uninterrupted.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded shadow cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-semibold text-lg text-brand-blue group-hover:text-brand-orange flex justify-between items-center\">\n                        7. Why is my AC throwing warm air?\n                        <span class=\"text-2xl transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-600\">Warm air usually indicates low refrigerant (gas leak), a dirty outdoor condenser coil, or a compressor failure. Our team can detect leaks using nitrogen pressure testing.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded shadow cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-semibold text-lg text-brand-blue group-hover:text-brand-orange flex justify-between items-center\">\n                        8. Are you authorized by specific brands?\n                        <span class=\"text-2xl transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-600\">We are a multi-brand service center. While we use genuine parts compatible with brands like Voltas, Blue Star, and Carrier, we operate independently to provide faster response times than authorized centers.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded shadow cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-semibold text-lg text-brand-blue group-hover:text-brand-orange flex justify-between items-center\">\n                        9. How long does a service take?\n                        <span class=\"text-2xl transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-600\">A standard chemical wash for a Cassette AC takes about 45 to 60 minutes per unit.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded shadow cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-semibold text-lg text-brand-blue group-hover:text-brand-orange flex justify-between items-center\">\n                        10. Is there a warranty on repairs?\n                        <span class=\"text-2xl transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-600\">Yes, we offer a warranty on spare parts (as per manufacturer policy) and a service warranty of 30 days for the specific issue repaired.</p>\n                </details>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Product Showcase (WooCommerce Style) -->\n        <section class=\"mb-16\">\n             <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-brand-blue mb-6\">Related Products &#038; Services</h3>\n             <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\">\n                <div class=\"border rounded p-4 hover:shadow-lg transition\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold\">Split AC Service</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-green-600 font-bold\">₹499.00</p>\n                    <a href=\"/split-ac-service-ahmedabad\" class=\"block mt-2 text-center bg-gray-200 py-1 rounded\">View</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"border rounded p-4 hover:shadow-lg transition\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold\">Window AC Repair</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-green-600 font-bold\">₹399.00</p>\n                    <a href=\"/window-ac-service-ahmedabad\" class=\"block mt-2 text-center bg-gray-200 py-1 rounded\">View</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"border rounded p-4 hover:shadow-lg transition\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold\">Refrigerator Repair</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-green-600 font-bold\">₹350.00</p>\n                    <a href=\"/refrigerator-repair-services-ahmedabad\" class=\"block mt-2 text-center bg-gray-200 py-1 rounded\">View</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"border rounded p-4 hover:shadow-lg transition\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold\">Rittal Panel AC</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-green-600 font-bold\">₹1500.00</p>\n                    <a href=\"/panel-ac-service-ahmedabad\" class=\"block mt-2 text-center bg-gray-200 py-1 rounded\">View</a>\n                </div>\n             </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Final CTA -->\n        <section class=\"bg-brand-blue text-white p-12 rounded-xl text-center\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">Need Urgent Cassette AC Repair in Ahmedabad?</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-xl mb-8\">We are just a call away. Available 24/7 for emergency breakdown services in GIDC and residential areas.</p>\n            <div class=\"flex justify-center gap-4\">\n                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"bg-white text-brand-blue font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded shadow hover:bg-gray-100 transition\">Call +91 97272 57141</a>\n                <a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"border-2 border-white text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded hover:bg-white hover:text-brand-blue transition\">Contact Us</a>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- WhatsApp Sticky Button -->\n    <a href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141\" class=\"fixed bottom-6 right-6 bg-green-500 text-white p-4 rounded-full shadow-2xl hover:bg-green-600 transition z-50 flex items-center gap-2 animate-bounce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n        <svg class=\"w-8 h-8\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M.057 24l1.687-6.163c-1.041-1.804-1.588-3.849-1.587-5.946.003-6.556 5.338-11.891 11.893-11.891 3.181.001 6.167 1.24 8.413 3.488 2.245 2.248 3.481 5.236 3.48 8.414-.003 6.557-5.338 11.892-11.893 11.892-1.99-.001-3.951-.5-5.688-1.448l-6.305 1.654zm6.597-3.807c1.676.995 3.276 1.591 5.392 1.592 5.448 0 9.886-4.434 9.889-9.885.002-5.462-4.415-9.89-9.881-9.892-5.452 0-9.887 4.434-9.889 9.884-.001 2.225.651 3.891 1.746 5.634l-.999 3.648 3.742-.981zm11.387-5.464c-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347-.297-.149-1.758-.868-2.031-.967-.272-.099-.47-.149-.669.149-.198.297-.768.967-.941 1.165-.173.198-.347.223-.644.074-.297-.149-1.255-.462-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.297-.347.446-.521.151-.172.2-.296.3-.495.099-.198.05-.372-.025-.521-.075-.148-.669-1.611-.916-2.206-.242-.579-.487-.501-.669-.51l-.57-.01c-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.626.712.226 1.36.194 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.695.248-1.29.173-1.414z\"/></svg>\n        <span class=\"hidden md:inline font-bold\">Chat on WhatsApp</span>\n    </a>\n\n</div>",
